, where sequence-parallel MoE splits the batch.\n  num-instances:\n  - 1\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    - 2\n    dp:\n    - 1\n    - 4\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    all2all_backend:\n    - deepep_high_throughput\n    - deepep_low_latency\n    - deepep_v2\n    - pplx\n- name: routing-prefix-cache\n  narrative: prefix-affinity should only beat random with caching on, since a cold\n    instance re-prefills the whole shared context.\n  num-instances:\n  - 2\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 2\n    pp:\n    - 2\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    gpu_memory_utilization:\n    - 0.95\n    enable_prefix_caching:\n    - true\n    - false\n  router:\n    endpoint_picker_config:\n    - random.yaml\n    - load-aware.yaml\n    - prefix-affinity.yaml\n- name: prefill-chunking\n  narrative: Capping long prefills should trade a little peak throughput for a much\n    lower ITL p99 at saturation.\n  num-instances:\n  - 1\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    - 4\n    pp:\n    - 1\n    - 2\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    long_prefill_token_threshold:\n    - 2048\n    - 8192\n- name: cudagraph\n  narrative: FULL-family capture should beat the PIECEWISE default by a few percent,\n    and NONE should collapse.\n  num-instances:\n  - 1\n  parallel:\n    tp:\n    - 8\n    enable_expert_parallel:\n    - true\n  engine:\n    cudagraph_mode:\n    - NONE\n    - FULL\n    - FULL_AND_PIECEWISE\n","sweeps":[{"configs":3,"dropped":[{"count":1,"gpus":2,"reason":"uses 2 GPUs, not the scenario's 8"},{"count":2,"gpus":4,"reason":"uses 4 GPUs, not the scenario's 8"},{"count":2,"gpus":16,"reason":"uses 16 GPUs, not the scenario's 8"},{"count":1,"gpus":32,"reason":"uses 32 GPUs, not the scenario's 8"}],"name":"topology-pp","narrative":"TP8 should peak highest, since every pipeline stage adds a boundary hop to each decode step.","spec":{"num-instances":[1],"parallel":{"enable_expert_parallel":[true],"pp":[1,2,4],"tp":[8,4,2]}}},{"confi